{
  "schemaVersion": "1.1.0",
  "id": "data-transformation-export-transformations",
  "title": "Export your transformations",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "You can export transformations manually as a CSV file."
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "To export the data transformations, open an existing panel with transformations applied in edit mode on your dashboard."
    },
    {
      "type": "section",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "guided",
          "content": "Do the following:\n- Click **Inspect queries** in the editor pane footer.\n- Select the **Data** tab.\n- Expand **Data options**.\n- Enable **Apply panel transformations**.\n- Click **Download CSV**.",
          "steps": [
            {
              "action": "highlight",
              "reftarget": "{grafana:components.PanelEditor.General.content} button[aria-label='Query inspector']"
            },
            {
              "action": "highlight",
              "reftarget": "grafana:components.Tab.title:Data"
            },
            {
              "action": "highlight",
              "reftarget": "{grafana:components.PanelInspector.Data.content} button[aria-label='Expand query row']"
            },
            {
              "action": "highlight",
              "reftarget": "{grafana:components.PanelInspector.Data.content} [data-testid='data-testid Switch container']:nth-match(1)"
            },
            {
              "action": "button",
              "reftarget": "Download CSV"
            }
          ],
          "requirements": [
            "exists-reftarget"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "content": "A CSV file containing the data set with transformations applied downloads to your machine.\n\nIn the next milestone, you'll wrap up this learning path."
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
